Subject: [PATCH 4/6] MinGW: CMake package discovery and harfbuzz-icu shim

- FindHarfBuzz.cmake: under WIN32, degrade the (MSYS2-)missing
  harfbuzz-icu component to the core library so the HarfBuzz::ICU
  target still exists for FreeType.cmake/Skia.cmake.
- mingw-compat hb-icu.h: inline shim reimplementing the only WebKit
  entry point hb_icu_script_to_script() on top of ICU
  uscript_getShortName + hb_script_from_string.
---
